== 2. Postman collection run (Newman 6.2.3) ==

$ cd documentation/postman
$ newman run "Campus Events API.postman_collection.json" \
    -e "Campus Events Local.postman_environment.json" \
    --reporters cli,json --reporter-json-export results.json

